cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the accompanying numerical results, please cite the manuscript and this repository."
title: "Protocol-bound numerical evaluation of D2NN robustness and hybrid optoelectronic inference"
abstract: >-
  Code, frozen experiment protocols, result summaries and manuscript sources for a
  protocol-bound numerical comparison of a baseline diffractive deep neural network, a
  perturbation-aware trained variant, a hybrid optoelectronic model and pure-electronic
  references on MNIST and Fashion-MNIST. Numerical simulation only; no physical optical
  bench or edge-device measurement is included.
type: software
license: MIT
